flowchart LR
  ML[Mother Leader] -->|assigned-sitio drafts, imports, outcomes| API[Scoped profiling RPC boundary]
  SEC[Barangay Secretary] -->|detail review, approve or return| API
  CAP[Barangay Captain] -->|approved detail, endorsement| API
  RES[PARAYA Researcher] -->|setup, samples, duplicates, lifecycle, completion| API
  DA[Director / Associate] -->|aggregate request only| AGG[Approved aggregate service]

  API -->|runtime, active account, capability, deny override, scope, version| DB[(Normalized profiling store)]
  DB -->|approved cycle/version facts| AGG
  AGG -->|k >= 5 and complementary suppression| DASH[Analytics and audited aggregate export]
  AGG -->|de-identified aggregate DTO only| AI[Advisory AI boundary]
  DB -->|immutable completion snapshot| EVID[Proposal evidence snapshot]

  ADMIN[System Admin] -. infrastructure only .-> OPS[Audit/configuration health]
  LEGACY[Legacy institutional identities] -. historical summaries only .-> HISTORY[Proposal/program history]
  DB -.-x ADMIN
  DB -.-x AI

%% No resident PII is sent to AI, blockchain, Admin browsing, legacy accounts,
%% or identifiable export. Runtime off denies collection and PII reads.
